  "body": "Home\nAbout us\nIndustries\nManufacturing and industrial\nArchitecture and Buildings\nServices\nScanning\nScan to BIM\nAs-Built Drafting\n3D Modeling\nBuilding analysis\nBOMA As-Built Digital Plans\nMatterport 3D Virtual Tours\nDigital Twins\nBlog\nCase studies\nContact\nGet in touch\n(514) 606-9604\nEnglish\nen\nFrançais\nfr\nWhy\npointSpace\n?\nWe are the most accessible and versatile solution for geospatial data interpretation in Quebec.\nExpertise\nExperts in spaces and their systems, we create clear, precise, and usable plans and models by combining point clouds with cutting-edge technology. Our customized 3D solutions give our clients complete control over their infrastructures.\nMission\nOur mission is to provide the most accessible and versatile solution for the interpretation of geospatial data. We use 3D scanning technologies and BIM solutions to deliver a digital twin tailored to your needs.\nMeet our team\nOur passionate team puts its expertise at your service to transform your ideas into concrete results. By your side every step of the way, we advise, support, and guide you toward the success of your projects.\nLouis Dallaire, CEO\nA graduate of ÉTS in operations and logistics engineering, Louis is passionate about the industrial world. His goal with pointSpace is to make data management and use accessible, because it's not always necessary to use complex tools to solve simple problems!\nButton\nPhilippe Dallaire, Founder\nWith over 30 years' experience in the building trade, Philippe is our serial contractor who guides us through this adventure!\nLeandro Lazaretti, Revit technician\nA graduate in CAD/BIM technologies with a background in architectural design, Leandro is our Revit modeling specialist at pointSpace, transforming point clouds and 3D scan data into accurate models. Thanks to his precision and attention to detail, he converts field-captured data into reliable, high-quality models that support our projects.\nButton\nThomas Sévigny, Project manager\nGraduate in civil engineering from Queen’s University in Kingston, Thomas is our technical expert at pointSpace. In his spare time, he’s exceptional at building furniture!\nMaxime Montreuil, Building surveying technician\nA graduate in Industrial Drafting from CIMME, Maxime is our field specialist at pointSpace. Detail-oriented and meticulous, he plays a key role in ensuring the accuracy and quality of the data collected during each of our projects.\nReady for a new challenge ?\nJoin the team\nContact us !\nLouis Dallaire\nldallaire@pointspace.ca\n(514) 606-9604\nContact Us\nFirst name\nLast name\nEmail\nMessage\nThank you for contacting us.\nWe will get back to you as soon as possible.\nOops, there was an error sending your message.\nPlease try again later.\nShare by:",
